R6 — 階段結案文件修補（FAR-R17 續行）\n\n依《S4 R6｜階段結案＋私人 Plugin 指揮薄》與《S4 R6 修補後外部獨立複驗與階段結案裁決》執行。**候選，未合併、未 tag、未 release。**\n\n### 這個 PR 改了什麼\n\n| 檔案 | 內容 |\n|---|---|\n| `docs/install/README.md` | 記錄已發布（immutable）伺服端文件的來源漂移：served `PIPD_WEB_FALLBACK.md`（sha256 `c88ddc49…`）自帶 `release_id: v0.1.1-preview.3`。**只能由下一次發行修正，不得原位替換。** |\n| `docs/USER_GUIDE.md` | 修補版本身分混淆：`main@d3bd545` 與 `preview.4@cc6c193` 不得互相偷換；同 `plugin_id` 的更新路徑。 |\n| `tests/test_r6_doc_identity_guard.py` | **新增**：安裝文件版本身分與頁內連結的守門測試（5 項實檔檢查 + 4 項配對 mutation）。 |\n| `.github/workflows/public-plugin-verify.yml` | **具名修正，見下節。** |\n\n### Authorized write-set amendment（具名、已揭露）\n\n上一版 PR 的 `verify` 檢查為 **failure**：本回合宣稱的 `stage-c` 寫入集**不含** `docs/USER_GUIDE.md`，而本回合的 WorkOrder（F-R6-02）具名要求該檔。修正是**單一路徑替代項**（非前綴），且同一 commit 內同步更新該臂自帶的 planted-path 自測，使「它證明界線」與「它宣告界線」保持一致。\n\n- 修正內容：`AMENDMENT S4-R6-20261016`，於 workflow 內具名註解說明理由。\n- 本回合只加**一個**產品檔；量測依據：同一分類器在 `origin/main`（`f4021ae...d3bd545`，25 路徑）**PASS**，且 R5R3 未曾觸碰該檔。\n- **未**把本回合的證據目錄納入寫入集（該臂明文拒絕回合自身收據）。\n\n### 證據包位置（變更）\n\n上一版把證據包放在產品分支，被同一個寫入集閘門拒絕（21 個 `S4_R6_CLOSEOUT_RETURN/**` 路徑）。依該 workflow 自身宣告的設計與既有回合慣例，證據包改置於專用分支：\n\n**`r6-closeout-evidence-20261016`**（`5defc64`，含被撤回的脈絡與完整證據包）— 外部驗收官請由該分支取得證據。\n\n### 驗證（可重跑）\n\n| 檢測 | 指令 | 結果 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 寫入集分類器（本地重導） | `R17_check_write_set.py` | `RESULT: PASS`（27 路徑全在集內） |\n| 該臂自測 | 由檔案讀出 regex 模擬 | `SELF_TEST: PASS` |\n| 守門測試 | `python -m unittest tests.test_r6_doc_identity_guard -v` | `Ran 9 tests … OK` |\n| 守門非空洞（對修補前樹 `d3bd545`） | 同上，置於該樹 worktree | `FAILED (failures=6)` |\n| 受影響子集 | 4 個模組 | `Ran 44 tests … OK` |\n| 全量 | `python -m unittest discover -s tests -t .` | `Ran 633 tests in 174.073s — OK (skipped=4)` |\n| 託管 CI（本 head `127ec1c`） | — | `verify` success；`offline-gate` success ×2 |\n\n獨立 VERIFY_SECURITY 派發（arm 釘選 `openai-codex/gpt-6.1-sol` rank 2；`danger-full-access` + guard root）：`ok:true`、`nonce ✓`、`usage ✓`，`checker_id PIPD-S4-R6-CLOSEOUT-20261016-FAR-R17-VERIFY_SECURITY-5defc64f`，**verdict `PARTIAL`**——C1/C2/C3/C5/C6/C7 PASS，C4 因 guard 邊界無法認證全量套件（非候選回歸；同套件於邊界外 `633 OK`）。該檢查員已自行下載並重算 ZIP：68,357 B / `545e359a…` 相符。\n\n### 宣告上限\n\n本 PR 為**受控分支上的候選**：未合併、未 tag、未 release、未動 `main`、未動 `v0.1.1-preview.4`。`S4_FULL_PASS` / `HOST_QUALIFIED` / `PRODUCTION` = **NOT_GRANTED**；私有宿主 UAT = **NOT_RUN**（需具上傳權限的人類帳號）。合併、tag、release 均屬 OWNER GATE。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-16T10:20:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-16T12:12:06Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1faba7255c991ef857c177a618a1a1b59b7f3d83","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"shw097-team:fix/s4r6-closeout-doc-identity-and-update-route-20261016","ref":"fix/s4r6-closeout-doc-identity-and-update-route-20261016","repo":{"id":1410587331,"node_id":"R_kgDOVBPaww","name":"PIPD-LS-SP","full_name":"shw097-team/PIPD-LS-SP","owner":{"login":"shw097-team","id":261346351,"node_id":"O_kgDOD5PULw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/261346351?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team","html_url":"https://github.com/shw097-team","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shw097-team/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"PIPD-LS-SP review candidate - governed HG-KSEOS